      "id": "claim_459c5b8953784bf0ab0df0f5933beaff",
      "statement": "The Docker Compose file defines two operating modes: the default (no profile) starts pgvector on port 5432, Keycloak on port 8080, and LocalStack on port 4566; adding `--profile app` additionally starts the api (:8001), agent (:8002), mcp (:8000), worker (no host port), and web (:5173) containers built from backend/Dockerfile targets.",
