      "id": "claim_6834976009d941a0bebb7ccc420b67e1",
      "statement": "LocalStack is initialised at startup by `local/localstack/init/ready.d/10-smart-tutor.sh`, which creates the S3 bucket `smart-tutor-documents` (with versioning and CORS for localhost:5173), the SQS queue `smart-tutor-ingest` with a DLQ, an S3→SQS notification on `uploads/` prefix, and an SSM parameter `/smart-tutor/learning-record-idle-minutes`.",
